The scorer (hepsimbench.score), the ROOT histogram converter, the Codabench bundle builder, the warm-rate timer
(hepsimbench.bench), the approximation registry (hepsimbench.approximations) and the robust statistics
(hepsimbench.stats), with their tests, were extracted from mu2e-fastsim (commit 929a28df) and
made experiment-neutral: the Mu2e task table, the Mu2e calorimeter ntuple converters and the per-workflow GPU launch
settings stay in mu2e-fastsim, which plugs the latter in through hepsimbench.bench.Extension. The synthetic
example was rewritten without experiment content.

No experiment-internal inputs, reference histograms, data or physics results are part of this repository.
